# argot writes a rebuildable voice model here — regenerate any time with `argot fit`.
# The model and the heavy `argot extract` dataset are build artifacts, not source;
# CI restores them from cache or re-fits. Delete this file to commit them yourself.
# (Your excludes and mutes live in argot.toml at the repo root — that one is committed.)
*

# Custom rules are team config, not a build artifact — they must ship with the
# repo so every contributor and CI run gets them on pull.
!rules/
!rules/**
# ...and this file itself, so the exception above survives a fresh clone.
# If `argot init` ever rewrites it, git will show the diff rather than
# silently dropping the rules from version control.
!.gitignore
